EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Once the {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Summer Solstice{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} is over,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
that means summer is in full
swing!
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}And THAT means ice cream!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}And ice cream is really the most
important part of summer.
